msgstr "Prima di continuare"

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-merge.php:1259
msgid "Mark the merged order as Processing so the sale still counts as paid."
msgstr "Segna l’ordine unito come In lavorazione, così la vendita conta ancora come pagata."

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-merge.php:1268
msgid "After merging"
msgstr "Dopo l’unione"

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-merge.php:1270
msgid "Order kept"
msgstr "Ordine mantenuto"

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-merge.php:1271
msgid "Orders cancelled"
msgstr "Ordini annullati"

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-merge.php:1272
msgid "Items in total"
msgstr "Articoli in totale"

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-merge.php:1273
msgid "New order total"
msgstr "Nuovo totale dell’ordine"

#: front-end/orders/brikpanel-order-merge.php:1276
msgid "This total is a projection. Tax is carried over exactly as each order recorded it, never recalculated at today's rates."
msgstr "Questo totale è una previsione. Le tasse vengono riportate esattamente come le ha registrate ogni ordine, mai ricalcolate alle aliquote di oggi."

#. translators: %d: number of orders that will be merged into the main order.
